<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SAEM Slide 2 - Microlearning</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .slide {
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            position: relative;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .shell {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 120px;
            left: 140px;
            right: 140px;
            bottom: 160px; /* Preserves SAEM footer area */
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .header-group {
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 72px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f2040;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .evidence {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            vertical-align: super;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        .visual-container {
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .core-message {
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 40px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0f2040;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .core-message span {
            color: #004b87;
        }
        svg text {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="slide">
        <img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

        <div class="content">
            <div class="header-group">
                <h1>The ED creates a learning-design problem.</h1>
                <h2>Emergency medicine is built around interruption, uncertainty, and time scarcity.<span class="evidence">[15, 23]</span></h2>
            </div>

            <div class="visual-container">
                <svg width="1640" height="400" viewBox="0 0 1640 400" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <!-- Base Timeline Axis -->
                    <line x1="20" y1="240" x2="1620" y2="240" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <text x="20" y="280" fill="#64748b" font-size="24" font-weight="600">Shift Start</text>
                    <text x="1520" y="280" fill="#64748b" font-size="24" font-weight="600">Shift End</text>

                    <!-- Clinical Load Blocks (Irregular) -->
                    <rect x="20" y="140" width="180" height="100" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="230" y="100" width="140" height="140" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="400" y="160" width="280" height="80" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="710" y="80" width="120" height="160" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="860" y="120" width="240" height="120" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="1130" y="150" width="180" height="90" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                    <rect x="1340" y="110" width="280" height="130" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" />

                    <!-- Interruptions (Red Markers) -->
                    <g stroke="#c8102e" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 6">
                        <line x1="215" y1="60" x2="215" y2="240" />
                        <line x1="385" y1="60" x2="385" y2="240" />
                        <line x1="695" y1="60" x2="695" y2="240" />
                        <line x1="845" y1="60" x2="845" y2="240" />
                        <line x1="1115" y1="60" x2="1115" y2="240" />
                        <line x1="1325" y1="60" x2="1325" y2="240" />
                    </g>

                    <!-- Interruption Icons -->
                    <g fill="#c8102e">
                        <polygon points="215,40 225,60 205,60" />
                        <polygon points="385,40 395,60 375,60" />
                        <polygon points="695,40 705,60 685,60" />
                        <polygon points="845,40 855,60 835,60" />
                        <polygon points="1115,40 1125,60 1105,60" />
                        <polygon points="1325,40 1335,60 1315,60" />
                    </g>
                    <text x="215" y="25" fill="#c8102e" font-size="20" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Interruption</text>

                    <!-- Microlearning Windows (Blue Blocks) -->
                    <rect x="205" y="200" width="20" height="40" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />
                    <rect x="375" y="200" width="20" height="40" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />
                    <rect x="685" y="200" width="20" height="40" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />
                    <rect x="835" y="200" width="20" height="40" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />
                    <rect x="1105" y="200" width="20" height="40" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />

                    <path d="M 1115 300 L 1115 250" stroke="#004b87" stroke-width="2" />
                    <circle cx="1115" cy="250" r="4" fill="#004b87" />
                    <text x="1115" y="330" fill="#004b87" font-size="22" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Micro-window (3 min)</text>

                    <!-- Traditional Long-Form Block (Out of sync) -->
                    <rect x="450" y="10" width="500" height="320" rx="12" fill="rgba(15, 32, 64, 0.03)" stroke="#0f2040" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="12 12" />
                    <rect x="600" y="-10" width="200" height="40" rx="20" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0f2040" stroke-width="2" />
                    <text x="700" y="17" fill="#0f2040" font-size="20" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">STRUCTURAL MISMATCH</text>
                    <text x="700" y="300" fill="#0f2040" font-size="28" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Traditional Didactic (45 min)</text>

                    <!-- Legend -->
                    <g transform="translate(20, 360)">
                        <rect x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#e2e8f0" />
                        <text x="36" y="18" fill="#4a5568" font-size="20">Clinical Load</text>

                        <rect x="180" y="0" width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#004b87" />
                        <text x="216" y="18" fill="#4a5568" font-size="20">Just-in-Time Learning</text>
                    </g>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="core-message">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#004b87" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                    <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
                </svg>
                The challenge is structural: <span>the learning format has to fit the work.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
